","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:47:57.373867","tool_call_id":"call_atA1K9m2MD2EDLatHqaCf0i1","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":17,"usage":null},{"content":"Airplane mode is currently on, mobile data is off, and data roaming is enabled. There is no cellular signal or connection. What should I do next? Also, regarding the data limit, I would prefer to refuel 2 GB of data instead of changing my plan.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:47:58.647837","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":18,"usage":{"completion_tokens":58,"prompt_tokens":2729}},{"content":"Here are the next steps.\n\n**1. Fix your phone settings**\n- Turn **Airplane Mode OFF**.\n- Then turn **Mobile Data ON**.\n- Tell me what you see after that. Check the status bar for signal strength and whether data is enabled.\n\n**2. Refuel 2 GB**\n- Refueling 2 GB at $2.00 per GB comes to **$4.00**. It will be added to your bill for line 555-123-2002.\n- Do you confirm you'd like me to go ahead? (yes/no)","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:48:01.619916","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":289,"prompt_tokens":13082}},{"content":"I will first turn off airplane mode and then turn on mobile data on my phone. After that, I will check the status bar for signal strength and data status. Also, yes, please go ahead and refuel 2 GB of data for me.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:48:03.420942","to